CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract callee
^\[my_log\.assigns\.\d+\] line 6 Check that g is assignable: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
The write set has to bind to the write set parameter that instrumentation adds
to my_log. When it was appended after the variadic argument, the variadic
argument bound to the write set parameter instead, and the assignment to g
was reported as not assignable although g is in the assigns clause.
